WEBVTT

NOTE
Hand-written test fixture for yt-learn; not taken from any site.

1
00:00.500 --> 00:00:02.000
Let us sketch a tiny queue service.

2
00:02.000 --> 00:04.000
Writers push jobs; readers pull them.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.500
Each job carries a short <i>retry</i> counter.

4
00:06.500 --> 00:08.000

5
00:03.000 --> 00:05.000
This cue starts too early and is dropped.

6
00:08.000 --> 00:10.000
A worker that crashes simply lets the lease expire.

7
00:10.000 --> 00:00:12.250
Then another worker picks the job up again.

8
00:12.500 --> 00:14.000
That is the whole idea.
